<title>UK: Britain's Eurodis warns on profits.</title>
<headline>Britain's Eurodis warns on profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Eurodis Electron Plc said on Wednesday that results for the year to May 31, 1997 would &quot;fall well short of current forecasts&quot;.</p>
<p>The electronics components distributor said in a statement that sales and margins had been below expectations and that high operational gearing and the strength of sterling would impact results.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
